meta {
  name: Melbourne Weather with Email
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/weather
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  `GET /weather`

  Legacy endpoint. Fetches weather for Melbourne (`Constants.DEFAULT_CITY_ID`,
  city ID `7839805`) **and sends an email notification** to the address stored in
  the `SMTPUsername` secret.

  Two things to know before firing this:

  - It has **no caching** - every call hits OpenWeatherMap.
  - It has a **side effect** - it sends a real email. Do not use it for load or
    smoke testing.

  Throws if the receiver email secret is not configured.
}
